  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi></math> satisfies the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>So, the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ω</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ω</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ω</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>14</mn></msup></math></p><p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ω</mi></math></p><p>Now, on comparing with equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
